OL,3,GNEWSAStories to make you smile from
OL,4,Aacross the West Midlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs arrests and medical stresses have
OL,7,Fdominated the headlines in recent
OL,8,Fweeks, some positive success stories
OL,9,Fhave still been happening across the
OL,10,FWest Midlands - and we want to
OL,11,Fhighlight them.
OL,13,FThis week, we have a woman who admitted
OL,14,Fshe got hooked on extreme day-tripping
OL,15,Fand how a driver born with no arms says
OL,16,Fhe is determined to make motorsport
OL,17,Fhistory.
OL,19,FHere is a look at some of those news
OL,20,Fstories from across the region:
